      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Finishing his story to the silent kitchen crew, Barani explains that the restaurant owner in Paris forced him to choose between lying or telling the truth about Barinov's absences, which led to Viktor Petrovich being fired. Just as Barani asks what any of them would have done in his place, Lyova announces that the meat roll is ready.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "В общем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я сказал правду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Либо правды.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Витя уволили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спросите меня, жалею ли я об этом поступке?",
      "gap": 0.55
